먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;금융기능 비탑재 학생증</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"181\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학사서비스센터 </span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"242\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청시 즉시 발급(5월 20일 이후)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;(카드 준비기간 : 4주)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"212\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;금융기능 탑재 학생증</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"181\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">변경 : 교내 농협</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"46\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"242\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;기존 안내문 참조</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 금융기능 비탑재 학생증 발급 건에 대해서는 기초카드 준비 후 상세히 안내할 예정</span>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금융기능 탑재 학생증 발급을 신청한 학생이 금융기능 비탑재 학생증으로 변경하고자 할 경우 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">→ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">기 제출한 신청서는 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교내 농협</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에서 취소하고</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학생증은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학사서비스센터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에서 발급</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 금융기능 비탑재 학생증 발급을 희망하는 학생 중 학생증 발급 전 (5월 20일 이전)까지 신분 확인증이 필요한 학생은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학사서비스센터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에서 발급 예정</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -16.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">2. 학생증(다기능 스마트 카드)의 출입통제 기능 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학생증</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(다기능 스마트 카드)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">에는 S1(SECOM)와 연동하여 각 건물 및 호실 별로</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">출입통제를 할 수 있는 기능이 탑재</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">되어 있으나, 학생들을 안전사고(화재사고 등)으</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">로부터 보호하고 효율적인 건물관리를 위해 스마트학생증으로 건물을 출입하</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">는 기능을 이용하지 않는 것으로 되어 있습니다. 따라서 스마트학생증으로 건물을 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">출</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">입할 수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 있는 기능의 활용 여부는 향후 의사결정 절차를 거쳐 결정할 예정입니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">2011. 4. 20</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">정보전산원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
